 data-bl-t=\"label\">View as a guest</span></span></a><a class=\"adm-nav__link\" href=\"/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"adm-nav__icon\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Open the site</span></span></a></div></aside><div class=\"adm-main\"><header class=\"adm-bar\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"header\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"adm-icon-button adm-bar__menu\" aria-label=\"Open the menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"admin-rail\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg></button><p class=\"adm-bar__where\"><span class=\"adm-bar__section\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Insight</span></span><span class=\"adm-bar__screen\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Jobs</span></span></p><button type=\"button\" class=\"adm-search\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"Control+K Meta+K\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M11 18a7 7 0 1 0 0-14 7 7 0 0 0 0 14zM20 20l-4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"adm-search__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Search or ask</span></span><kbd class=\"adm-kbd\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Ctrl K</span></kbd></button><a class=\"adm-ask\" href=\"/admin/assistant\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.9 5.1L19 10l-5.1 1.9L12 17l-1.9-5.1L5 10l5.1-1.9zM18.5 15.5l.8 2.2 2.2.8-2.2.8-.8 2.2-.8-2.2-2.2-.8 2.2-.8z\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Ask</span></span></a></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"ops\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Jobs\"><div class=\"con-head\"><h1 class=\"ops-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Jobs</span></h1><details class=\"con-about\"><summary aria-label=\"About Jobs\" title=\"About Jobs\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zM12 11v5.5M12 7.5h.01\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"con-about__body\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Background work: retries with backoff, one row per job, claimed optimistically. A runner tick claims from what is queued and due.</span></div></details></div><div class=\"con-stats\" data-bl-b=\"\"><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Queued</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0 due now</span></span></div><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Running</span></span></div><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Dead</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">nothing stuck</span></span></div><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">0</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Succeeded</span></span></div><div class=\"con-stat\"><span class=\"con-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">—</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Oldest due</span></span><span class=\"con-stat__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">waiting for a runner</span></span></div></div><section id=\"attention\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"attention-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Needs a decision\"><div class=\"con-section-head\"><h2 id=\"attention-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Needs a decision</span></h2><details class=\"con-about\"><summary aria-label=\"About Needs a decision\" title=\"About Needs a decision\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zM12 11v5.5M12 7.5h.01\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"con-about__body\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Retrying allows exactly one more attempt and keeps the attempt history. Cancelling applies to a queued job only: a running one is held by a worker.</span></div></details></div><p class=\"con-caption con-caption--standalone\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Failed and dead jobs</span></p><p class=\"con-empty-note\" role=\"status\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">No job has failed. Nothing to do here.</span></p></section><section id=\"types\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"types-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"By type\"><div class=\"con-section-head\"><h2 id=\"types-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">By type</span></h2><details class=\"con-about\"><summary aria-label=\"About By type\" title=\"About By type\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zM12 11v5.5M12 7.5h.01\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"con-about__body\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">A type with rows but no registered handler can never run in this process — usually a handler that was removed, or a runner started without the module that registers it.</span></div></details></div><p class=\"con-caption con-caption--standalone\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Jobs by type</span></p><p class=\"con-empty-note\" role=\"status\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">No job has ever been enqueued.</span></p><p class=\"con-note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Registered but never used: </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">ai.purge_sessions, housekeeping.purge, media.cluster, media.derive, media.index, media.process, media.sweep, rsvp.send_confirmation</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></p></section><section id=\"recent\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"recent-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Recent\"><div class=\"con-section-head\"><h2 id=\"recent-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Recent</span></h2><details class=\"con-about\"><summary aria-label=\"About Recent\" title=\"About Recent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zM12 11v5.5M12 7.5h.01\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"con-about__body\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The last rows to change, whatever their state — the quickest way to see whether the queue is moving at all.</span></div></details></div><p class=\"con-caption con-caption--standalone\"><span data-bl-